[I] High quality, one-dimensional sample-rate conversion library

[T] The SoX Resampler library libsoxr performs one-dimensional sample-rate
[T] conversion, e.g. to resample PCM-encoded audio. It aims to give fast and
[T] very high quality results for any constant rational or irrational ratio,
[T] with configurable phase response, bandwidth and aliasing parameters, and
[T] also offers a variable-rate mode.

[U] https://sourceforge.net/projects/soxr

[A] Soxr Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

